('gb:sk-ns-01:2', 'sk-ns-01', 2, 'safety_licensing', null, '2027-03-31', 'partner', 'Eleven profiles need defence in depth at level 2. Co-deliver a practical module with an international partner''s training centre instead of building from scratch; our instructors shadow the first two runs.', 'تحتاج أحد عشر ملفاً وظيفياً إلى الدفاع في العمق بالمستوى 2. نقدّم وحدة عملية بالشراكة مع مركز تدريب لشريك دولي بدلاً من البناء من الصفر، ويرافق مدربونا أول دورتين.', '{"title":"Defence in depth in practice (co-delivered)","level":2,"hours":24}'::jsonb, '[{"role_id":"shift-supervisor","horizon":"now","before":86,"after":93,"delta":7},{"role_id":"shift-technical-advisor","horizon":"now","before":64,"after":79,"delta":15},{"role_id":"systems-design-plant-engineer","horizon":"now","before":50,"after":63,"delta":13},{"role_id":"nuclear-oversight-npi","horizon":"now","before":67,"after":83,"delta":16},{"role_id":"emergency-preparedness-coordinator","horizon":"now","before":90,"after":100,"delta":10},{"role_id":"shift-supervisor","horizon":"2030","before":79,"after":85,"delta":6},{"role_id":"shift-technical-advisor","horizon":"2030","before":65,"after":75,"delta":10},{"role_id":"systems-design-plant-engineer","horizon":"2030","before":64,"after":73,"delta":9},{"role_id":"nuclear-oversight-npi","horizon":"2030","before":63,"after":75,"delta":12},{"role_id":"emergency-preparedness-coordinator","horizon":"2030","before":79,"after":86,"delta":7},{"role_id":"fr-adv-instructor","horizon":"2030","before":79,"after":86,"delta":7}]'::jsonb, 'decided', '2026-10-08', 'p-training-mgr', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-10-06T09:00:00Z', '[{"at":"2026-10-06T09:00:00Z","by":"p-training-mgr","route":"partner","due_on":"2027-03-31","owner_role":"safety_licensing"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-06T09:00:00Z'),
