('gb:sk-qa-01:2', 'sk-qa-01', 2, 'quality', 'p-head-sq', '2027-02-28', 'buy', 'Nine profiles need NQA-1 requirements at level 2. Licensed e-learning already exists on the market; buy seats and add a local assessment rather than writing our own content.', 'تحتاج تسعة ملفات وظيفية إلى متطلبات NQA-1 بالمستوى 2. يوجد في السوق تعلم إلكتروني مرخّص؛ نشتري مقاعد ونضيف تقييماً محلياً بدلاً من كتابة محتوى خاص بنا.', '{"title":"NQA-1 requirements, licensed e-learning","level":2,"hours":12}'::jsonb, '[{"role_id":"maintenance-technician-engineer","horizon":"now","before":88,"after":100,"delta":12},{"role_id":"nuclear-fuel-specialist","horizon":"now","before":75,"after":100,"delta":25},{"role_id":"quality-assurance-qc","horizon":"now","before":20,"after":60,"delta":40},{"role_id":"procurement-engineer","horizon":"now","before":0,"after":40,"delta":40},{"role_id":"maintenance-technician-engineer","horizon":"2030","before":73,"after":82,"delta":9},{"role_id":"nuclear-fuel-specialist","horizon":"2030","before":86,"after":100,"delta":14},{"role_id":"quality-assurance-qc","horizon":"2030","before":29,"after":57,"delta":28},{"role_id":"procurement-engineer","horizon":"2030","before":21,"after":50,"delta":29},{"role_id":"fr-owners-engineer","horizon":"2030","before":33,"after":50,"delta":17}]'::jsonb, 'decided', '2026-10-08', 'p-training-mgr', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-10-07T09:00:00Z', '[{"at":"2026-10-07T09:00:00Z","by":"p-training-mgr","route":"buy","due_on":"2027-02-28","owner_role":"quality"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-07T09:00:00Z'),
