('gb:sk-sc-01:2', 'sk-sc-01', 2, 'human_performance', 'p-training-mgr', '2027-01-31', 'build', 'Ten profiles need a questioning attitude at level 2. A short in-house practice clinic with scenario debriefs fits the safety-culture programme better than any external offer.', 'تحتاج عشرة ملفات وظيفية إلى موقف التساؤل بالمستوى 2. عيادة تدريب داخلية قصيرة مع جلسات استخلاص للسيناريوهات تناسب برنامج ثقافة السلامة أكثر من أي عرض خارجي.', '{"title":"Raising concerns: practice clinic","level":2,"hours":8}'::jsonb, '[{"role_id":"nuclear-oversight-npi","horizon":"now","before":67,"after":83,"delta":16},{"role_id":"human-performance-specialist","horizon":"now","before":83,"after":100,"delta":17},{"role_id":"ecp-officer","horizon":"now","before":50,"after":83,"delta":33},{"role_id":"industrial-health-safety-officer","horizon":"now","before":83,"after":100,"delta":17},{"role_id":"corporate-professional","horizon":"now","before":50,"after":63,"delta":13},{"role_id":"nuclear-oversight-npi","horizon":"2030","before":63,"after":75,"delta":12},{"role_id":"human-performance-specialist","horizon":"2030","before":75,"after":88,"delta":13},{"role_id":"ecp-officer","horizon":"2030","before":50,"after":70,"delta":20},{"role_id":"industrial-health-safety-officer","horizon":"2030","before":70,"after":80,"delta":10},{"role_id":"corporate-professional","horizon":"2030","before":60,"after":70,"delta":10}]'::jsonb, 'decided', '2026-10-08', 'p-training-mgr', 'p-training-mgr', '2026-10-07T09:00:00Z', '[{"at":"2026-10-07T09:00:00Z","by":"p-training-mgr","route":"build","due_on":"2027-01-31","owner_role":"human_performance"}]'::jsonb, '2026-10-07T09:00:00Z'),
